              <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gar-text-primary mb-4">Title Bars</h3>
              <p class="text-gar-text-secondary mb-4">
                Title bars are optional frame windows drawn by gar. They enable gradient borders and window titles.
              </p>
              <div class="rounded-lg overflow-hidden border border-gar-text-muted/20 mb-6">
                <pre class="bg-gar-bg-primary p-4 overflow-x-auto"><code class="text-sm text-gar-text-primary font-mono">{`-- Enable title bars
gar.set("titlebar_enabled", true)
gar.set("titlebar_height", 20)
