              <h4 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gar-text-primary mb-3">Automatic garbar</h4>
              <p class="text-gar-text-secondary mb-4">
                If <code class="text-gar-accent-blue">gar.bar</code> table exists in your config, garbar is spawned automatically:
              </p>
              <div class="rounded-lg overflow-hidden border border-gar-text-muted/20 mb-6">
                <pre class="bg-gar-bg-primary p-4 overflow-x-auto"><code class="text-sm text-gar-text-primary font-mono">{`-- Enable garbar auto-spawn
gar.bar = {}

-- Or manually start garbar
gar.exec_once("garbar")`}</code></pre>
              </div>

              <h4 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gar-text-primary mb-3">EWMH Properties</h4>
